    "# DFU Repair-7 — Local Upload + Direct CPU v2\n",
    "\n",
    "Upload `DFU_GOOD38_RECOVERY_EVIDENCE.zip` when prompted. This version directly patches the pinned v1.6 runner, restores the missing `label_name`, preserves a valid incomplete BAD7 repair checkpoint for resume, and skips an extra epoch if early-stopping patience was already exhausted."
